  "source_scope": {
    "root_and_current": "The original processWithSourceFamily/runtime definitions are modified in place. Original exact Frame and cfg determine stock roots/current/material; process State remains ULift Nat. Private Stage is recursive assembler calculation data, not an authoritative root/process/controller.",
    "source_only": "Factory, initial complete Frame, actual firstCfg and LowVar identity are the only source inputs. advance matches current actual data.1.action. stageAt is Nat.rec of previous current; no completed table, future receipt, target/coverage/terminal/nonzero/physicality value enters the constructor.",
    "cfg": "nextBase retains template component/reader/calculationReader and only installs WB same-source oldPaid plus supplied actual native event decoder. Final stockCfg then applies existing Inventory.programme: its generated stock reader is used, base calculationReader is preserved, and the existing source decoder is routed through the original lowResult. It is not claimed that final reader literally equals factory reader.",
    "full_inventory": "stockCfg uses existing writtenSeed and Pair.Residual.pairInventory on actual frame occurrence. Both current inventories and factory callbacks are retained by nested Stock.preserve, and actual generated stock is added. Stock/depth growth proves erased state identity, not physical or semantic strict payment.",
    "write": "Only the designated source sort is written with the actual total value; all other sorts read the actual receiver environment. The same LowVar language equality transports types/factory, not occurrence identities.",
    "admission": "Existing StockAdmission compiler/target/root/whole installs actual nextCfg before its emitter. Full first_target_full recognizes its target StockTarget presentation, not just a firstSuccessor restriction.",
    "paid": "Current family grade/Packet seed/base cfg persist; data.1.mathNext is the literal next source Frame. StockTarget.successor_valid and its actual generated native next are consumed.",
    "settled": "Current actual inl settlement generates literal Shared.nextBorn with the same stockCfg/base decoder. That complete born, its new registered AST and the accumulated seed form the next admission Packet. nextCfg/oldPaid are freshly generated from that source, without default reset.",
    "runtime": "The original activationLaw.ofUnique picks the unique source query of each actual stage. process successor_valid verifies full canonical next; actual_node/query/next/receipt/whole read the same runtime. actual_receipt remains a Prop resolution_eq_generated; actual_branch_receipt retains the complete Type receipt separately.",
    "chronology": "firstReceipt and firstPaidAt are downstream readouts. Nat.zero_add Eq.mp transports preserve exact Type distance and full paid Step. Tick0 is admission, ticks1+offset cover all actual paid prefix through selected settlement, and tick1+distance+1 is fresh born admission. Original grade producers remain grade-indexed; they are not relabeled macro ticks.",
    "controls": "Positive first paid distance comes from actual native AST budget and existing exact source clock/receipt_distance_exact. Actual selected settled compiler cannot be old always-answered. Named original RH source directly consumes this same runtime and the complete source whole/next/word action.",
    "scope": "Generic actual runtime source/control chain is certified, with syntax-stock/depth used only for State injectivity. Original R source, full p/r, native residual, source fee and original physical payment remain distinct. CP102 own Shared runtime is not identified with this runtime.",
    "effective_action_reader": "At the actual epoch datum, actionReader = calculationReader.getD reader. Inventory.programme preserves base.calculationReader and replaces reader by Inventory.reader. For None, effective native action is Inventory.raw: environment=lowRaw.environment; expression=physicalRaw.expression substituted by constants from physicalRaw.environment. Inventory.query_value identifies physicalResult, not the original factory lowResult. Original lowRaw/lowResult and its paid exposure survive in completeMaterial/written stock coface. For Some, the preserved calculationReader is selected. No general equality or faithful preservation of arbitrary original factory effective action is claimed."
  },
